esources  and this was just so this is like we had  not anticipated antique a car fit  as part of a demographic and so here is  dom art ali who runs the auto antique  show in the queens and it's this kind of  roving thing and that really exploded  what we think of as the general public  and so now as we're continuing to go  across the country here we are at Grand  Canyon  we're just rethinking this idea of  general public and opening our minds as  to who who is interested in domestic  workers rights and these new ways to  support domestic employers and workers  and that's been the most interesting  thing for me thank you

